threshold, with annotations, scope =\neach widget's own /Rect. The court's own page reads 0 dark pixels inside all\n19 rects at 128, 160 AND 200 with annotations hidden -- which is the entire\nbasis for calling this chrome rather than form. After: 0 at all 19 rects at\nall three thresholds on all four fixtures, 0 pixels ADDED anywhere on any\npage, and the five IL pages with no button pixel-identical.\n\nIt also swept the Connecticut failure mode in the same commit rather than\nwaiting to be caught by it: both field maps carried the sentence \"flatten()\ncarries the source's own button caption into the delivered page\", and the\nself-test that asserted 17 rows claiming ink now asserts 17 detached and zero\nclaiming ink.\n\nONE THING IT FOUND THAT IS NOT ITS DEFECT AND IS WORSE THAN ITS DEFECT: the\ndelivered Illinois packet carries 13 live JavaScript app.launchURL actions\nreachable from the catalog, on 13 of its 22 surviving /Link annotations. The\nshared finalizer refuses to emit such bytes; this builder never asks it. 13\nbefore and 13 after, untouched, and recorded separately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01W3FAJNotS5DdvyJS1khjid","timestamp":"2026-09-10T13:04:07Z","author":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com"},"committer":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com"}},"repository":{"id":1248656766,"node_id":"R_kgDOSmz9fg","name":"legalease-partner-dashboard-clean","full_name":"Roger-LegalEase/legalease-partner-dashboard-clean","private":false,"owner":{"login":"Roger-LegalEase","id":287531360,"node_id":"U_kgDOESNhYA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287531360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roger-LegalEase","html_url":"https://github.com/Roger-LegalEase","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roger-LegalEase/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roger-LegalEase/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"ht